1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Her blood doesn't match her body.

2
00:00:02,343 --> 00:00:06,400
After a miscarriage, doctors in Brazil tested a woman's blood...

3
00:00:06,592 --> 00:00:09,200
...and found male XY chromosomes.

4
00:00:09,339 --> 00:00:13,450
But her skin, her mouth, every other cell —

5
00:00:13,606 --> 00:00:16,200
female, XX.

6
00:00:16,385 --> 00:00:19,600
She wasn't sick. The test wasn't wrong.

7
00:00:19,736 --> 00:00:23,700
Before birth, her twin brother's blood flowed into her veins...

8
00:00:23,851 --> 00:00:25,800
...and his cells never left.

9
00:00:25,924 --> 00:00:29,100
Today, her body runs on her brother's blood.

10
00:00:29,262 --> 00:00:32,700
One body. Two humans' DNA.
